.git vendor/my-3d2dge 2>&1 | tail -2\ngit -C vendor/my-3d2dge sparse-checkout set dist/handoff 2>&1 | tail -2\nls vendor/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff\nfor f in session.js harness.html bridge.js round.js README.md; do\n  curl -fsSL -o vendor/hub/$f https://raw.githubusercontent.com/michaelcrosato/ai-hub/main/lib/hub/$f || echo FAIL $f; done\nls -la vendor/hub","description":"Create dev folder and fetch engine and hub client"}}}
